eX` 的 softmax 实现与同一算子下 `moe_gating_top_k_generalized.h`、`moe_gating_top_k_e_k_fullload.h` 以及自身文件中 `SelectTopKExpertScore` 的 Duplicate+Div 模式保持一致。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T17:54:34+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T17:54:34+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177359616,"discussion_id":"5c6a31aef906d5c8ab7464eb361755669472305c","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T17:55:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T17:55:46+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177398943,"discussion_id":"b85e635e8487ae7108f947216530713bb397d7f0","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-06-27T09:03:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T09:03:52+08:00","user":{"id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","login":"songkai111","object_id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","name":"songkai111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/songkai111"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177402911,"discussion_id":"f83239e26da4ddab1acbc71ae33cfaa271aad090","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-06-27T09:28:37+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T09:28:37+08:00","user":{"id":"68844ee22fa6cc24b2556707","login":"cc-z","object_id":"68844ee22fa6cc24b2556707","name":"赵臣臣","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cc-z"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]